{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06252","headline":"湖中寄王侍御 · 丘爲","name":"湖中寄王侍御","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"日日湖水上，好登湖上楼。\n终年不向郭，过午始梳头。\n尝自爱桮酒，得无相献酬。\n小僮能脍鲤，少妾事莲舟。\n每有南浦信，仍期後月游。\n方春转摇荡，孤兴时淹留。\n骢马真傲吏，翛然无所求。\n晨趋玉阶下，心许沧江流。\n少别如昨日，何言经数秋。\n应知方外事，独往非悠悠。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"丘爲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06252.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06252","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}